{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2021-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1619136000, "end_date": 1619827199, "month_true_total": 69, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:19:14 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "91170512", "author": {"steamid": "76561198902794198", "personaname": "vitulaspir2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198902794198/", "num_games_owned": 174, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 1378, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 594, "last_played": 1658174700, "avatar": "b36005f719bf8bb6749594b38b8676d4ebe7515b"}, "language": "english", "review": "very enjoyable and a lot of fun ,despite not having multiplayer there are some ways to play with friends!", "timestamp_created": 1619791251, "timestamp_updated": 1619791251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91121170", "author": {"steamid": "76561198091278827", "personaname": "lloyd119187", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198091278827/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 981, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 981, "last_played": 1617743530, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Here's the thing, I bought it because a lot of people say its great, but that's just the thing. Its not a good game, not because of the look, or the gameplay itself, but I would say its the concept that fails to me. Its a time attack type of game: get to the final boss as fast as possible before it gets too difficult to beat. Well, here's where it contradicts itself, if you get there fast enough, you might have to leave a lot of items behind. If you take too long, enemies would be too strong for you, even with items. Not only that, you have to be lucky to head in the right direction, there's a chance that you go to one side of the map, only to find out that it was in the other way, which wastes more time.\n\nI guess roguelike games aren't my type, but I tried to give it a chance, and its charm ran out real fast.", "timestamp_created": 1619723440, "timestamp_updated": 1619723440, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.462723672389984131", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91073089", "author": {"steamid": "76561199063792753", "personaname": "A Cat in Time", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199063792753/", "num_games_owned": 236, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 245, "last_played": 1631732184, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "english", "review": "Warning you may get wet", "timestamp_created": 1619642095, "timestamp_updated": 1619642095, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91070902", "author": {"steamid": "76561198189661407", "personaname": "John Megabones", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198189661407/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 2523, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 180, "last_played": 1729438163, "avatar": "5452e61eee4a9c73fdd895656e33ff8acbeff109"}, "language": "english", "review": "", "timestamp_created": 1619638802, "timestamp_updated": 1619638802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.558830618858337402", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "91037882", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168609306", "personaname": "Гвоздени Крст", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GvozdeniKrst/", "num_games_owned": 219, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 641, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 338, "last_played": 1682120393, "avatar": "8278d6866e8a9a086e0401dbf7167ad941e78753"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game has a great balance of challenge and fun. There are huge levels that may or may not have different paths open in different runs. Lots of items with various usablility and effects. As well as many characters, items and artifacts (an artifact being a modifier setting that can drastatically change the way the game is played such as the artifact of command which lets you choose the items removing the rng) to unlock giving it lots of replaybility as well as really interesting lore and story if you care for that though you'll have to dig a little for it. If you like a simple but replayable with different builds you could do with items I highly recommend", "timestamp_created": 1619585028, "timestamp_updated": 1619585028, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}